%% TECH-001 Automatic pipeline (CI)
flowchart TD
    Code[Change on a branch] --> Push[git push]
    Push --> CI["CI on GitHub<br/>npm ci, lint, type check,<br/>build, test:local<br/>R1, R2, R5"]
    Push --> Preview[Vercel preview deploy]
    CI --> Green{All green?}
    Green -- no --> Report[Red check +<br/>Playwright report<br/>R4]
    Report --> Code
    Green -- yes --> PR[Pull request merged to main<br/>R6]
    PR --> Deploy[Vercel production deploy]
    Deploy --> Live["Live tests on GitHub<br/>npm test against the live site<br/>R3"]
    Live --> LiveOk{All green?}
    LiveOk -- no --> LiveReport[Red check +<br/>Playwright report<br/>R4]
    LiveOk -- yes --> Done[Done]
